    title "Derek Chauvin trial continues with witness testimony for second day - 3/30 (FULL LIVE STREAM)"
    description "The trial of Derek Chauvin, the former Minneapolis police officer filmed with his knee on George Floyd&amp;#8217;s neck, continues on March 30. He is charged with murder and manslaughter for Floyd&amp;#8217;s death on May 25, 2020. This stream contains graphic content.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The first day of the trial included blunt witness testimony and video footage from Floyd&amp;#8217;s fatal arrest, laying the groundwork for court proceedings that will center on precisely what happened that day. Judge Peter Cahill ruled that he would allow audio for the testimony of witnesses who were minors at the time of Floyd&amp;#8217;s death, but he prohibited video of their testimony. Read more: https://wapo.st/3m34zZW. Subscribe to The Washington Post on YouTube: https://wapo.st/2QOdcqK&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow us:&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/washingtonpost&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/washingtonpost/&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/washingtonpost/"
