  [
    id 191
    label "533E-fv6yCM"
    step 0
    date "2021-04-01T22:15:23Z"
    title "Derek Chauvin trial: Minneapolis police sergeant on duty during Floyd arrest testifies"
    description "The state continues to build its case on day 4 of the Derek Chauvin trial with testimony from Minneapolis police Sgt. David Pleoger who was on duty during the Floyd arrest. Firefighter Jeremy Norton, Hennepin EMS paramedic Derek Smith and fellow paramedic Seth Bravinder preceded him on the stand. The day began with testimony from George Floyd's girlfriend Courteney Ross, who told the court that both of them suffered from chronic pain, were given prescriptions and became addicted. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;https://www.kare11.com/article/news/local/george-floyd/derek-chauvin-trial-police-video-cup-foods-george-floyd-minneapolis/89-ff17e42f-0137-4f54-a611-dd8d8b64a0bc&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Chauvin faces three charges, second-degree murder, second-degree manslaughter and third-degree murder in the death of George Floyd, who died in police custody in May 2020.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;WARNING: Some of the images depicted in the video and testimony are graphic.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Have questions about the trial for KARE 11 reporter Lou Raguse? Ask them at @LouRaguse on Twitter, or  Text TRIAL to 763-797-7215. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Here are the latest case updates for former Minneapolis police officers Derek Chauvin, J. Alexander Kueng, Tou Thao and Thomas Lane, charged in the death of George Floyd: https://www.kare11.com/georgefloyd&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#chauvintrial #georgefloyd #courteneyross #derekchauvin #emschauvintrial &amp;#10;&amp;#8212; &amp;#10;Welcome to the KARE 11 News YouTube channel. Subscribe to our channel for compelling and dramatic storytelling, award winning investigations, breaking news and information you can use. &amp;#10;Text your photos, videos and news tips to 763-797-7215.&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Subscribe to KARE 11 on YouTube: https://www.youtube.com/user/KARE11?s...&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Watch more KARE 11 video: https://www.youtube.com/user/KARE11/v...&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Visit KARE11.com: http://www.kare11.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Download our app! https://www.kare11.com/appredirect&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Find KARE 11 on Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/KARE11/&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Follow KARE 11 on Twitter: https://twitter.com/kare11&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Follow KARE 11 on Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/kare11/"
