    description "Watch the full interview now, ad-free as a VladTV Youtube Member - https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCg7lal8IC-xPyKfgH4rdUcA/join&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Part 5: https://youtu.be/3uPbpKiRpcw&amp;#10;Part 1: https://youtu.be/HsCVhDb5EYA&amp;#10;--------&amp;#10;In the latest clip, Boskoe100 spoke on Derek Chauvin getting convicted for murdering George Floyd. He expressed a feeling of relief after the verdict was announced and recalled being a kid when the cops who assaulted Rodney King were found not guilty. Boskoe felt Derek Chauvin's conviction was a long-awaited victory for Black and said the police finally seem &amp;#34;touchable.&amp;#34; After Vlad said he witnessed some Black people crying tears of joy, Boskoe added that the trial was way bigger than OJ Simpson's."
