    label "yKN4_rpz844"
    step 0
    date "2021-03-30T22:09:55Z"
    title "MN v. Derek Chauvin Trial Day 2 - Genevieve Hansen Eyewitness/Off-Duty Firefighter"
    description "As seen on footage, the defendant kneeled on the victim&amp;#8217;s neck for minutes during a fateful arrest on May 25, 2020, while co-defendants Thomas Lane and J. Alexander Kueng were on the man&amp;#8217;s back and legs. Floyd, who was handcuffed behind his back, was face down in the street, saying he could not breathe. He called out for his late mother. Angry bystanders demanded Chauvin remove the knee. Floyd became unresponsive. Authorities carried his limp body onto a stretcher.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#DerekChauvin #GeorgeFloyd #LawAndCrimeNetwork&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You may already have access to the Law&amp;#38;Crime Network! Find out here: https://lawandcrime.com/where-to-watch/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;No access? That's okay! Subscribe direct to Law&amp;#38;Crime here: https://lawandcrime.com/subscribe/&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Watch Us Live On Peacock Daily Free: https://www.peacocktv.com/watch/home  &amp;#10;Click on Channels &amp;#38; Scroll Down to Law &amp;#38; Crime Network&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Derek Chauvin Trial Live Stream&amp;#10;Derek Chauvin Trial Live Coverage&amp;#10;Watch Live Derek Chauvin Trial"
