    step 0
    date "2021-03-31T23:00:14Z"
    title "Justin Miller on the Derek Chauvin Trial Over George Floyds Death | KnowThis"
    description "This week, the murder trial for Derek Chauvin began with eyewitnesses of the death of George Floyd delivering emotional testimony. Zinhle Essamuah talks to Justin Miller, the Floyd family attorney, about the trial, the jury, and the past year of racial reckoning.&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Subscribe to NowThis: http://go.nowth.is/News_Subscribe&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Sign up for our newsletter KnowThis to get the biggest stories of the day delivered straight to your inbox: https://go.nowth.is/KnowThis&amp;#10;&amp;#10;0:00 Intro&amp;#10;0:46 The Heart of the Derek Chauvin Trial&amp;#10;2:48 Jury Selection&amp;#10;3:51 Expectations for Trial&amp;#10;7:15 Assassination of George Floyd's Character&amp;#10;9:34 Message to the Public&amp;#10;10:25 George Floyd's Legacy&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The first few days of the Derek Chauvin trial over George Floyd&amp;#8217;s death have included emotional testimony from eyewitnesses, including Darnella Frazier, the teenage girl who recorded the incident, and an EMT who pleaded with officers to check for George Floyd&amp;#8217;s pulse. We talk to Justin Miller, the attorney representing the family of George Floyd, about the ongoing Derek Chauvin trial, the jury selection process, his expectations for an outcome, how the city is braced with heightened security measures, and the legacy of George Floyd beyond the Black Lives Matter movement.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#JustinMiller #GeorgeFloyd #DerekChauvin #KnowThis #News #NowThis&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Connect with NowThis&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Like us on Facebook: http://go.nowth.is/News_Facebook&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Tweet us on Twitter: http://go.nowth.is/News_Twitter&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Follow us on Instagram: http://go.nowth.is/News_Instagram&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Find us on Snapchat Discover: http://go.nowth.is/News_Snapchat&amp;#10;&amp;#10;NowThis is your premier news outlet providing you with all the videos you need to stay up to date on all the latest in trending news. From entertainment to politics, to viral videos and breaking news stories, we&amp;#8217;re delivering all you need to know straight to your social feeds. We live where you live.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;http://www.youtube.com/nowthisnews&amp;#10;@nowthisnews"
