    date "2021-04-09T17:00:14Z"
    title "Derek Chauvin Trial, Gymnasts Vaccine Flex, and More | KnowThis"
    description "Law enforcement officials broke the &amp;#8216;blue wall of silence&amp;#8217; in testimony against former cop Derek Chauvin for the death of George Floyd. We&amp;#8217;re covering this story and more on this week&amp;#8217;s segment with Zinhle Essamuah.&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Subscribe to NowThis: http://go.nowth.is/News_Subscribe&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Sign up for our newsletter KnowThis to get the biggest stories of the day delivered straight to your inbox: https://go.nowth.is/KnowThis&amp;#10;&amp;#10;0:00 Intro&amp;#10;0:14 Gymnast's Vaccine Card Flex&amp;#10;0:46 Arkansas Anti-Trans Medical Ban&amp;#10;2:05 MLB Moves All-Star Game From Georgia&amp;#10;3:40 Biden Moves Up Vaccine Eligibility&amp;#10;4:51 Police Testify Against Derek Chauvin&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Multiple law enforcement officials testified against one of their own during week two of the Derek Chauvin trial.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;This week, the murder trial against Derek Chauvin continued and featured testimony from a number of law enforcement officials. President Joe Biden sped up the COVID-19 vaccine eligibility timeline for all Americans. Major League Baseball moved its all-star game from Georgia after the state passed a law limiting voting rights. Arkansas became the first state to ban certain medical treatments for trans youth. And, college gymnast Evan Manivong picked the perfect moment to remind everyone to get vaccinated.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#DerekChauvin #GeorgeFloyd #COVID19 #KnowThis #News #NowThis&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Connect with NowThis&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Like us on Facebook: http://go.nowth.is/News_Facebook&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Tweet us on Twitter: http://go.nowth.is/News_Twitter&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Follow us on Instagram: http://go.nowth.is/News_Instagram&amp;#10;&amp;#187; Find us on Snapchat Discover: http://go.nowth.is/News_Snapchat&amp;#10;&amp;#10;NowThis is your premier news outlet providing you with all the videos you need to stay up to date on all the latest in trending news. From entertainment to politics, to viral videos and breaking news stories, we&amp;#8217;re delivering all you need to know straight to your social feeds. We live where you live.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;http://www.youtube.com/nowthisnews&amp;#10;@nowthisnews"
