    label "6Rn3i7WNXBo"
    step 0
    date "2021-10-05T02:17:10Z"
    title "Derek Chauvin Still Eligible for $1 Million Pension"
    description "Hundreds of police officers who have been convicted of felonies can still get their pensions.   &amp;#10;Derek Chauvin, who murdered Minneapolis man George Floyd in May 2020, is eligible for his pension totaling $1 million, despite the murder conviction.   &amp;#10;Melanie Hicken, a senior writer and investigative reporter for CNN, joins &amp;#8220;Making the Case&amp;#8221; to discuss officers getting their pensions.  &amp;#10;&amp;#8220;A pension guarantees you a certain set amount of money every year until you pass away,&amp;#8221; Hicken says.     &amp;#10;&amp;#10;All this and more on &amp;#8220;Making the Case.&amp;#8221;  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;To watch BNC programming, visit https://bnc.tv/how-to-watch/   &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow BNC on social media:    &amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/BNCNews  &amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/BNCNews   &amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/bncnews/?hl=en  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#DerekChauvin #Pensions #GeorgeFloyd"
