  [
    id 329
    label "Hk_1EsjX28s"
    step 0
    date "2021-06-25T19:33:16Z"
    title "Derek Chauvins Defense Attorney Speaks Before Sentencing"
    description "After testimony from George Floyd's family, statements from the prosecution, and testimony from Derek Chauvin's mother, Eric Nelson stands before Judge Peter Cahill to speak at Chauvin's sentencing.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Nelson says he has received impact statements and that the impact on the city was profound. &amp;#34;It has been at the forefront of our national consciousness, and it has weaved its way into nearly every facet of our lives,&amp;#34; he says. Citing conversations he's had with Chauvin, Nelson says the former officer wonders how different life would be if he hadn't responded to the call or if he skipped work on May 25, 2020.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;To watch BNC programming, visit https://bnc.tv/how-to-watch/  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Follow BNC on social media:  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/BNCNews  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/BNCNews  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/bncnews/?hl=en &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#DerekChauvin #EricNelson #GeorgeFloyd"
