  [
    id 349
    label "5cSeagK9jRM"
    step 0
    date "2021-10-30T03:04:01Z"
    title "Oklahoma Botched Execution of Inmate, Derek Chauvin Jurors Speak Out"
    description "In the trending legal stories, John Marion Grant is the first person to be executed in Oklahoma since it imposed a moratorium following a series of flawed executions. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;According to an Associated Press reporter watching the execution, Grant began convulsing and vomiting after receiving the first drug and passed out. He was then given the final two lethal drugs. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Jurors in the Derek Chauvin trial speak out for the first time, months after convicting the former Minneapolis police officer of murdering George Floyd.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;In April, that jury found him guilty of second-degree unintentional murder, third-degree murder and second-degree manslaughter. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;All this and more on &amp;#8220;Making the Case.&amp;#8221; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;To watch BNC programming, visit https://bnc.tv/how-to-watch/ &amp;#10;Follow BNC on social media: &amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/BNCNews  &amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/BNCNews  &amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/bncnews/?hl=en &amp;#10; &amp;#10;#JohnGrant #DerekChauvin #MakingTheCase"
