    title "Derek Chauvin Trial: Witnesses begged police to help George Floyd"
    description "BNC&amp;#8217;s Dray Clark reports from Minneapolis on Day 2 of the Derek Chauvin trial, where emotional witnesses testified on what they observed on May 25, 2020.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Witnesses from a mixed martial arts fighter to a 9-year-old girl told jurors that they saw George Floyd&amp;#8217;s final moments and pleaded for Chauvin to remove his knee from Floyd&amp;#8217;s neck.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8220;They were not listening to anything that I was telling them. I felt like I had to speak out for Floyd because he was speaking out to the officer and there was no feedback, no emotion,&amp;#8221; said witness Donald Williams II.  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;To watch George Floyd: Justice on Trial and other BNC programming, visit https://bnc.tv/how-to-watch/  &amp;#10;&amp;#10;#BNC  #JusticeonTrial"
