    title "Legal Expert Breaks Down Kim Potter Trial, Derek Chauvin and More"
    description "In the trial of former Brooklyn Center police officer Kim Potter, Daunte Wright&amp;#8217;s autopsy report was shared in court today as an assistant medical examiner said his gunshot wound wasn&amp;#8217;t survivable. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Also in Minnesota, former police officer Derek Chauvin is reportedly set to change his plea to guilty in the federal civil rights case against him. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Myles Cosgrove, the detective who fatally shot Breonna Taylor during a raid, is appealing his termination from the Louisville Metro Police Department. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;BNC legal correspondent Laura McNeal joins Marc Lamont Hill on &amp;#8220;Black News Tonight&amp;#8221; to break down these cases. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;All this and more on &amp;#8220;Black News Tonight.&amp;#8221; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;To watch BNC programming, visit https://bnc.tv/how-to-watch/ &amp;#10;Follow BNC on social media: &amp;#10;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/BNCNews  &amp;#10;Twitter: https://twitter.com/BNCNews  &amp;#10;Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/bncnews/?hl=en &amp;#10; &amp;#10;#KimPotter #DerekChauvin #MarcLamontHill"
