    id 373
    label "qNeRh_c7vRk"
    step 0
    date "2021-12-15T19:22:49Z"
    title "Derek Chauvin pleads guilty to federal charges in George Floyd case | New York Post"
    description "Former Minneapolis cop Derek Chauvin pleaded guilty Wednesday to violating George Floyd&amp;#8217;s civil rights.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Chauvin, 45, who is already serving a 22-year-sentence after being convicted of murder in Floyd&amp;#8217;s death in April, initially pleaded not guilty to the federal charge brought against him in May.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;He changed his plea in a Minnesota courtroom on Wednesday, KARE-TV said in a report.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#DerekChauvin #GeorgeFloyd #BLM&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The New York Post is your source for breaking news, news about New York, sports, business, entertainment, opinion, real estate, culture, fashion, and more.&amp;#13;&amp;#10;&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Catch the latest news here: https://nypost.com/&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Follow The New York Post on:&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Twitter - https://twitter.com/nypost&amp;#13;&amp;#10;Facebook - https://www.facebook.com/NYPost"
