    description "The experienced criminal attorney, George Tragos, hosts today's video and gets listeners up to date on the Derek Chauvin Trial.   &amp;#10;&amp;#10;In this video, Mr. Tragos answers listener questions like &amp;#34;is there a blue wall&amp;#34;, &amp;#34;what is our prediction&amp;#34;, &amp;#34;why are violent videos like this allowed on social media&amp;#34;, and much more. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you have more questions about this topic, please leave them below &amp;#38; we will try to get to them asap!&amp;#10;&amp;#10;George Floyd was killed on 25 May 2020 in Minneapolis. His death prompted a worldwide protest.&amp;#10;Legal Analysis&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#lawyeryouknow&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203; #georgefloyd&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203; #derekchauvin&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128308; Subscribe for more free YouTube tips:&amp;#10; https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxAH...&amp;#8203;...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Share this video with a YouTuber friend:&amp;#10;https://youtu.be/LFZT2_lZNbE&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; For business inquiries contact me at lawyeryouknow@gmail.com&amp;#10;&amp;#9989; Let's connect: www.tragoslaw.com&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Twitter - @tragoslaw&amp;#10;Instagram - /tragoslaw&amp;#10;Facebook - /tragoslaw&amp;#10;TikTok - /tragoslaw&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128308; Watch next &amp;#8211; https://youtu.be/kysHZUhQfA4&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128308; Recommended Playlist &amp;#8211; https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list...&amp;#8203;...&amp;#10;&amp;#10;NOT LEGAL ADVICE&amp;#10;&amp;#10; https://www.tragoslaw.com/clearwater-criminal/"
