    description "&amp;#128680;&amp;#9878;&amp;#65039; In this video, Alyte gives a recap of the Derek Chauvin trial. Specifically, she goes over what the jury had to conclude to convict him of George Floyd's murder on all three charges. She also goes over some of the critiques of the verdict, and gets into what's next (possible appeals, for example due to Representative Maxine Waters' commentary, and more). What do you think? Come check it out, and let us know your thoughts in the comments! &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Affiliate links to stuff we use (we may make a small amount of money if you purchase through the link): &amp;#10;&amp;#10;*Crypto Cartel: A Card Game (Use promo code &amp;#34;LEGAL&amp;#34; for free shipping!):* https://www.andythegamemaker.com/store/cryptocartel &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Soundstripe Music (you get 20% off!): https://app.soundstripe.com/referrals/90583 &amp;#10;Sony a6400: https://amzn.to/319kKw2 &amp;#10;Neewer Lights: https://amzn.to/34cPkXu &amp;#10;Rode VideoMic Pro+ Shotgun Mic: https://amzn.to/349w9xS &amp;#10;ESDDI Video Light: https://amzn.to/3g7hoOn &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212; &amp;#10;&amp;#10;Social Links: &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#128038; twitter.com/legalbytesmedia &amp;#10;&amp;#128248; instagram.com/legalbytesmedia &amp;#128241;&amp;#10;Facebook.com/legalbytesmedia &amp;#10;&amp;#11088;&amp;#65039;If you&amp;#8217;d like to support Legal Bytes, check us out on Patreon! patreon.com/legalbytes &amp;#10;&amp;#10;If you want to learn more about Legal Bytes: &amp;#10;&amp;#127760; http://legalbytesmedia.com &amp;#10;&amp;#127796;&amp;#127963;If you&amp;#8217;re in California or DC and need to talk to a lawyer: &amp;#10;&amp;#127760; Mazeika Law: http://mazeikalaw.com &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&amp;#8212;&a