    title "Derek Chauvin Trial Day 12 Analysis: Jury Panel Officially Completed!"
    description "The court in the Derek Chauvin trial fills the jury panel with a total of 15 jurors finally selected with opening arguments to start next week. &amp;#10;&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Chauvin trial finally has 15 jurors ready for opening arguments starting March 29. &amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Review of the 15 jurors on the panel and the details about who they are, including professions and demographics. &amp;#10;&amp;#8226; How will each juror vote? We take a look and tally the results.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Full LIVE stream here: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AplL4Mp-KSI&amp;#10;&amp;#10;#WatchingtheWatchers #GeorgeFloyd #Floyd #criminaldefense #criminaldefenseattorney #murder #DerekChauvin #ChauvinTrial #CourtofAppeals #Minneapolis #protests #blm #juryselection&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Connect with us:&amp;#10;&amp;#8226;&amp;#160;Locals! https://watchingthewatchers.locals.com&amp;#10;&amp;#8226;&amp;#160;Podcast (audio): https://watchingthewatchers.buzzsprout.com/&amp;#10;&amp;#8226;&amp;#160;Facebook: https://www.facebook.com/robertgruleresq&amp;#10;&amp;#8226;&amp;#160;Rumble: https://rumble.com/c/RobertGrulerEsq&amp;#10;&amp;#8226;&amp;#160;Homepage with transcripts: https://www.watchingthewatchers.tv&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Miss Faith: https://www.instagram.com/faithie_joy/&amp;#10;&amp;#8226; NEW! Now on Clubhouse: @RobertGrulerEsq @faith_joy &amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Twitch: https://www.twitch.tv/robertgruleresq&amp;#8203; &amp;#10;&amp;#8226; Homepage with transcripts: https://www.watchingthewatchers.tv&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Don't forget to join us on Locals! https://watchingthewatchers.locals.com&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Head over to Locals to continue the conversation before and after the show. You can also grab the slides (and other stuff) from the show as well as a free PDF copy of Robert&amp;#8217;s book which is also available to buy on Amazon here: https://rcl.ink/hHB&amp;#8203;&amp;#10;&amp;#10;The firm can be reached at: &amp;#10;R&amp;#38;R Law Group, PLLC